WEBVTT

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.282
WHAT'S THAT?

00:00:12.326 --> 00:00:15.547
[ BREATHING RAGGEDLY ]

00:00:17.853 --> 00:00:19.551
[ INHALES DEEPLY ]

00:00:20.377 --> 00:00:24.294
[ Muffled ]
WHAT'S THAT SMELL?

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:31.911
[ WARBLE ]

00:00:39.135 --> 00:00:42.008
[ INHALES DEEPLY ]

00:00:42.051 --> 00:00:44.663
[ WARBLE ]

00:00:44.706 --> 00:00:45.925
[ MUFFLED THUD ]

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:47.622
[ Muffled ]
WHAT YOU DOING?

00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:49.102
[ Muffled ]
IT'S HEAVY.

00:00:49.145 --> 00:00:50.669
OH, SORRY.
DO YOU WANT ME TO CARRY IT?

00:00:50.712 --> 00:00:52.671
YEAH, THANK YOU.OH, DON'T BE RIDICULOUS.
PICK IT UP.

00:00:52.714 --> 00:00:54.673
[ BREATHING RAGGEDLY ]

00:00:54.716 --> 00:00:57.763
[ SIGHS ]

00:00:57.806 --> 00:01:00.548
[ MUFFLED LAUGH ]

00:01:00.592 --> 00:01:03.203
SNATCHERS.

00:01:03.246 --> 00:01:06.249
GOOD TO KNOW
YOUR ENCHANTMENTS WORK.

00:01:11.472 --> 00:01:14.780
HE COULD SMELL IT --
MY PERFUME.

00:01:17.652 --> 00:01:19.132
I'VE TOLD YOU.

00:01:19.175 --> 00:01:22.788
RON ISN'T STRONG ENOUGH
TO APPARATE.

00:01:22.831 --> 00:01:26.052
WELL, THEN...
WE'LL GO ON FOOT.

00:01:26.095 --> 00:01:28.620
AND NEXT TIME, HERMIONE,

00:01:28.663 --> 00:01:31.971
AS MUCH AS I LIKE YOUR PERFUME,
JUST DON'T WEAR ANY.

00:01:35.409 --> 00:01:40.544
AND NOW FOR THE NAMES
OF MISSING WITCHES AND WIZARDS.

00:01:40.588 --> 00:01:43.939
THESE ARE CONFIRMED.

00:01:43.983 --> 00:01:48.161
THANKFULLY,
THE LIST IS SHORT TODAY.

00:01:48.204 --> 00:01:50.642
JASON AND ALISON DENBRIGHT...

00:01:50.685 --> 00:01:52.644
OH, THANK YOU.

00:01:52.687 --> 00:01:56.082
...BELLA, JAKE, CHARLIE,
AND MADGE FARLEY...

00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:57.736
JOE LAURIE...

00:01:57.779 --> 00:02:02.131
ELEANOR SARAH GIBBS....

00:02:02.175 --> 00:02:06.135
HARRY AND BRONWYN TRIGG...

00:02:06.179 --> 00:02:08.703
ROB AND ELLIE DOWSON...

00:02:08.747 --> 00:02:11.184
[ RADIO TUNING]

00:02:11.227 --> 00:02:14.927
...GEORGIA CLARK-DAY...

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:17.973
JOSHUA FLEXSON...

00:02:18.017 --> 00:02:20.497
GEORGE COUTAS...

00:02:20.541 --> 00:02:23.413
GABRIELLA AND EMILY MATHER...

00:02:23.457 --> 00:02:27.200
JACOB AND MIMI ERLAND...

00:02:27.243 --> 00:02:30.159
...WILLIAM
AND BRIAN GALLAGHER...

00:02:30.203 --> 00:02:32.858
HE DOESN'T KNOW
WHAT HE'S DOING, DOES HE?

00:02:35.251 --> 00:02:37.950
NONE OF US DO.

00:02:37.993 --> 00:02:40.082
[ RADIO TUNING]

00:02:43.564 --> 00:02:46.393
...KATIE AND JAMES KILLICK...

00:02:46.436 --> 00:02:49.004
ELSIE VALENTINE SCHROEDER...

00:02:49.048 --> 00:02:52.181
JENNIFER WINSTON...

00:02:52.225 --> 00:02:55.184
TAMSIN AND IOLA HILLICKER...

00:02:55.228 --> 00:02:58.666
SCARLET AND KITTY SHARP...

00:03:03.062 --> 00:03:05.238
[ SCISSORS CUTTING ]

00:03:16.205 --> 00:03:18.338
OH, MY GOD!

00:03:18.381 --> 00:03:20.383
WHAT?

00:03:20.427 --> 00:03:23.082
I'LL TELL YOU IN A MINUTE.

00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:25.954
MAYBE
YOU COULD TELL ME NOW.

00:03:25.998 --> 00:03:28.130
THE SWORD OF GRYFFINDOR --

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:29.741
IT'S GOBLIN-MADE.

00:03:29.784 --> 00:03:30.959
BRILLIANT.

00:03:31.003 --> 00:03:34.310
NO, YOU DON'T UNDERSTAND.

00:03:34.354 --> 00:03:37.139
DIRT AND RUST HAVE NO EFFECT
ON THE BLADE.

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:41.361
IT ONLY TAKES IN THAT
WHICH MAKES IT STRONGER.

00:03:41.404 --> 00:03:43.885
OKAY.

00:03:43.929 --> 00:03:46.975
HARRY, YOU'VE ALREADY DESTROYED
ONE HORCRUX, RIGHT?

00:03:47.019 --> 00:03:49.412
TOM RIDDLE'S DIARY
IN THE CHAMBER OF SECRETS.

00:03:49.456 --> 00:03:50.805
Harry:
WITH A BASILISK FANG.

00:03:50.849 --> 00:03:52.502
IF YOU TELL ME
YOU'VE GOT ONE OF THOSE

00:03:52.546 --> 00:03:54.200
IN THAT BLOODY
BEADED BAG OF YOURS...

00:03:54.243 --> 00:03:55.810
DON'T YOU SEE?

00:03:55.854 --> 00:03:57.333
IN THE CHAMBER OF SECRETS,

00:03:57.377 --> 00:03:59.988
YOU STABBED THE BASILISK
WITH THE SWORD OF GRYFFINDOR.

00:04:00.032 --> 00:04:03.557
ITS BLADE IS IMPREGNATED
WITH BASILISK VENOM.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.820
IT ONLY TAKES IN THAT
WHICH MAKES IT STRONGER.

00:04:05.864 --> 00:04:07.561
EXACTLY, WHICH IS WHY...

00:04:07.604 --> 00:04:09.345
IT CAN DESTROY HORCRUXES.

00:04:09.389 --> 00:04:12.827
AND THAT'S WHY DUMBLEDORE
LEFT IT TO YOU IN HIS WILL.

00:04:12.871 --> 00:04:14.655
YOU ARE BRILLIANT,
HERMIONE.

00:04:14.698 --> 00:04:16.222
TRULY.

00:04:16.265 --> 00:04:18.137
ACTUALLY,
I'M HIGHLY LOGICAL,

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:20.748
WHICH ALLOWS ME TO LOOK PAST
EXTRANEOUS DETAIL

00:04:20.792 --> 00:04:23.446
AND PERCEIVE CLEARLY
THAT WHICH OTHERS OVERLOOK.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:24.708
YEAH.

00:04:24.752 --> 00:04:26.058
THERE'S ONLY ONE PROBLEM,
OF COURSE.

00:04:31.063 --> 00:04:33.587
THE SWORD WAS STOLEN.

00:04:34.893 --> 00:04:37.547
YEAH.
I'M STILL HERE.

00:04:37.591 --> 00:04:39.854
BUT YOU TWO CARRY ON.

00:04:39.898 --> 00:04:43.118
DON'T LET ME SPOIL
THE FUN.

00:04:43.162 --> 00:04:44.380
WHAT'S WRONG?

00:04:44.424 --> 00:04:45.642
WRONG?

00:04:45.686 --> 00:04:47.601
NOTHING'S WRONG.

00:04:47.644 --> 00:04:49.646
NOT ACCORDING TO YOU,
ANYWAY.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:52.171
LOOK, IF YOU'VE GOT SOMETHING
TO SAY, DON'T BE SHY.

00:04:52.214 --> 00:04:53.433
SPIT IT OUT.

00:04:53.476 --> 00:04:56.001
ALL RIGHT,
I'LL SPIT IT OUT.

00:04:56.044 --> 00:04:57.829
BUT DON'T EXPECT ME
TO BE GRATEFUL

00:04:57.872 --> 00:04:59.831
JUST BECAUSE NOW THERE'S ANOTHER
DAMN THING WE'VE GOT TO FIND.

00:04:59.874 --> 00:05:01.615
I THOUGHT YOU KNEW
WHAT YOU SIGNED UP FOR.

00:05:01.658 --> 00:05:04.618
YEAH.
I THOUGHT I DID, TOO.

00:05:04.661 --> 00:05:07.882
WELL, THEN, I'M SORRY,
BUT I DON'T QUITE UNDERSTAND.

00:05:07.926 --> 00:05:11.451
WHAT PART OF THIS ISN'T
LIVING UP TO YOUR EXPECTATIONS?

00:05:11.494 --> 00:05:14.367
D-DID YOU THINK WE WERE GONNA BE
STAYING IN A FIVE-STAR HOTEL

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.064
FINDING A HORCRUX
EVERY OTHER DAY?

00:05:16.108 --> 00:05:17.370
YOU THOUGHT YOU'D BE BACK
WITH YOUR MUM BY CHRISTMAS.

00:05:17.413 --> 00:05:19.328
I JUST THOUGHT
AFTER ALL THIS TIME

00:05:19.372 --> 00:05:21.461
WE WOULD HAVE ACTUALLY
ACHIEVED SOMETHING.

00:05:21.504 --> 00:05:23.332
I THOUGHT YOU KNEW
WHAT YOU WERE DOING.

00:05:23.376 --> 00:05:25.030
I THOUGHT DUMBLEDORE WOULD HAVE
TOLD YOU SOMETHING WORTHWHILE.

00:05:25.073 --> 00:05:26.422
I THOUGHT YOU HAD A PLAN.

00:05:26.466 --> 00:05:28.294
I TOLD YOU EVERYTHING
DUMBLEDORE TOLD ME.

00:05:28.337 --> 00:05:30.905
AND, IN CASE YOU HAVEN'T
NOTICED, WE HAVE FOUND
A HORCRUX ALREADY.

00:05:30.949 --> 00:05:32.689
YEAH, AND WE'RE ABOUT AS CLOSE
TO GETTING RID OF IT

00:05:32.733 --> 00:05:34.387
AS WE ARE TO FINDING
THE REST OF THEM, AREN'T WE?

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:35.997
Ron.

00:05:36.041 --> 00:05:39.696
PLEASE TAKE --
PLEASE TAKE THE HORCRUX OFF.

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:42.482
YOU WOULDN'T BE SAYING
ANY OF THIS IF YOU HADN'T
BEEN WEARING IT ALL DAY.

00:05:42.525 --> 00:05:44.658
DO YOU WANT TO KNOW WHY
I LISTEN TO THAT RADIO
EVERY NIGHT, DO YOU?

00:05:44.701 --> 00:05:47.704
TO MAKE SURE
I DON'T HEAR GINNY'S NAME

00:05:47.748 --> 00:05:49.924
OR FRED OR GEORGE
OR MUM.

00:05:49.968 --> 00:05:51.273
WHAT, YOU THINK
I'M NOT LISTENING, TOO?!

00:05:51.317 --> 00:05:53.232
YOU THINK I DON'T KNOW
HOW THIS FEELS?!

00:05:53.275 --> 00:05:55.060
NO, YOU DON'T KNOW
HOW IT FEELS!

00:05:55.103 --> 00:05:57.366
YOUR PARENTS ARE DEAD.
YOU HAVE NO FAMILY.

00:05:58.367 --> 00:05:59.499
STOP! STOP!

00:05:59.542 --> 00:06:01.240
FINE, THEN GO!

00:06:01.283 --> 00:06:03.198
GO, THEN!

00:06:09.901 --> 00:06:12.555
RON.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.343
AND YOU?

00:06:17.386 --> 00:06:19.867
ARE YOU COMING,
OR ARE YOU STAYING?

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.181
FINE.

00:06:29.224 --> 00:06:31.487
I GET IT.

00:06:31.531 --> 00:06:34.055
I SAW YOU TWO
THE OTHER NIGHT.

00:06:34.099 --> 00:06:36.884
RON,
THAT'S -- THAT'S NOTHING.

00:06:38.625 --> 00:06:40.366
RON!

00:06:43.499 --> 00:06:46.720
RON,
WHERE ARE YOU GOING?

00:06:46.763 --> 00:06:49.244
[ In distance ]
PLEASE COME BACK.

00:06:50.419 --> 00:06:52.552
RON!

00:06:56.599 --> 00:06:57.818
RON!

00:06:57.861 --> 00:06:59.602
[ WHOOSHING ]

00:07:21.015 --> 00:07:23.931
[ BIRDS CHIRPING ]

